  "extraction_notes": "Entry 8 contains a subscript '3' for the methylene chain, which corresponds to an ornithine derivative. Entry 9 side-chain structure matches dimethyl glutamate. All amino acid derivatives are assigned the L-configuration based on the drawings. Formamide (HCONH2) is used in 5 equivalents and acts as both the acyl source and likely the solvent. For entry 5, the headline yield (96%) is recorded, with the 5 mmol scale result (97%) noted in the yield_note. Reactants 7a–i are inferred from the generic reactant 7 and specific products 8a–i."
